    "body": "> What do you think about including this intermediate format in the spec?\r\n\r\nI don't think we should put any intermediate representation in the spec as it then makes future optimizations more difficult in the implementation.  I think we want the flexibility to change the intermediate representation in the future.  Also, none of this stuff should be observable to sites.",
