    "body": "Also, I wonder if the Map oriented approach to associating data with entries will make it hard to have a constructor that takes dictionaries instead of full URLPatterns.  Not sure if the dictionaries shortcut is worth optimizing for at the cost of added complexity elsewhere.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
